  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left left\"><mtr><mtd><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and we know that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\" columnspacing=\"1.4ex\"><mtr><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left left\"><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, differentiating using product rule,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\" columnspacing=\"1.4ex\"><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\" columnspacing=\"1.4ex\"><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Since&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is an oscillating function and hence it&nbsp;is non-monotonic in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8746;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
